Thought: The proton NMR spectra shows a signal at 2.93 ppm with a doublet of doublets (dd) pattern, which is characteristic of a CH3 group. However, to confirm this, I should check the carbon NMR spectra to see if there is a corresponding signal for a methyl group. This will help ensure the accuracy of the identification.
Action: carbon_nmr_spectra
